tly — the mud is churned to soup on the far bank. You drink from the near side, upstream of whatever it was."},{"day":5,"viaSay":true,"text":"Movement — a small fish flashing in the water."},{"day":5,"viaSay":true,"text":"✅ You saw the creek. Rosa nods. \"Good. Now we know.\" (+integration)"},{"day":5,"viaSay":true,"text":"🗣️ Victor to Vasyl, by the fire: \"Stone. We need 60 more for the palisade footings. Creek beds, hillsides — pry it loose.\""},{"day":6,"viaSay":true,"text":"📋 Fiona wants to know what's by the creek. \"Just look. Come back and tell me.\""},{"day":6,"viaSay":true,"text":"💧 Fiona returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"day":6,"viaSay":true,"text":"Travel 1 tile to creek."},{"day":6,"viaSay":true,"text":"✅ You saw the creek. Fiona nods. \"Good. Now we know.\" (+integration)"},{"day":6,"viaSay":true,"text":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"day":6,"viaSay":true,"text":"Travel 1 tile to creek.\n— Moving water —\nWater over stone, loud enough to cover your noise. You could drink here without announcing it."},{"day":6,"viaSay":true,"text":"Movement — crayfish under every second rock."},{"day":7,"viaSay":true,"text":"📋 A man, maybe 50s, with a limp wants to know what's by the creek. \"Just look. Come back and tell me.\""},{"day":7,"viaSay":true,"text":"🪨 Fiona pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"day":8,"viaSay":true,"text":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"day":9,"viaSay":true,"text":"💧 Stan returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"day":9,"viaSay":true,"text":"Travel 1 tile to creek."},{"day":9,"viaSay":true,"text":"✅ You saw the creek. Stan nods. \"Good. Now we know.\" (+integration)"},{"day":9,"viaSay":true,"text":"📋 Victor wants to know what's by the creek. \"Just look. Come back and tell me.\""},{"day":10,"viaSay":true,"text":"🪨 Stan pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"day":10,"viaSay":true,"text":"Travel 1 tile to creek."},{"day":10,"viaSay":true,"text":"✅ You saw the creek. Victor nods. \"Good. Now we know.\" (+integration)"},{"day":10,"viaSay":true,"text":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"day":10,"viaSay":true,"text":"Travel 1 tile to creek."},{"day":10,"viaSay":true,"text":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Living Wire: Get OUT of the water. When the crackling starts, step onto dry ground — the discharge cannot reach you there. On land it is just a long blind fish: slow, harmless, dinner. Never fight it standing in the"},{"day":10,"viaSay":true,"text":"📓 Codex: Counter: Get OUT of the water — When the crackling starts, step onto dry ground — the discharge cannot reach you there. On land it is just a long blind fish: slow, harmless, dinner. Never fight it standing in the creek."},{"day":11,"viaSay":true,"text":"Travel 1 tile to creek."},{"day":11,"viaSay":true,"text":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"day":11,"viaSay":true,"text":"Travel 1 tile to creek."},{"day":11,"viaSay":true,"text":"Oscar leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Nightlight. Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.\""},{"day":11,"viaSay":true,"text":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Nightlight: Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"day":11,"viaSay":true,"text":"📓 Codex: Counter: Never wade in — The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp."},{"day":12,"viaSay":true,"text":"The cistern is dry. Haul from a creek (risky water), or put someone on water duty."},{"day":12,"viaSay":true,"tex